---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Leandro Ubilla - Web developer";
const description = "Thoughtful web development that helps businesses and creators craft meaningful user journeys with a focus on design, functionality, and performance.";
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-pretty text-xl text-base-content py-10 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-semibold text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6 lg:text-3xl leading-none tracking-tight">About me</h1>
    <p class="mb-6">
      Hi, I'm Leandro. I build thoughtful websites for agencies and brands. It started in 2008, when I built my first website with plain HTML and CSS and offered free MySpace templates. Soon after, I launched three Flash game sites. Their "database" was a <code>.txt</code> file on a friend's server until I could afford DreamHost. The designs weren't great, but I was learning one page at a time.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      By 2010, I'd built a network of Flash game sites with PHP, MySQL, and HTML. They attracted real traffic. Then Google Panda hit, and I had to pivot.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      In 2012, I moved into WordPress and freelancing, building websites and WooCommerce stores with a local studio and later on Fiverr.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      Since then, I've picked up Webflow, React, Framer, and UI design. Today, I work with agencies and brands to build websites. You can find my portfolio at <a href="https://scriptingpixels.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/70 transition-colors">Scripting Pixels</a>, or <a href="mailto:leandroubilla@protonmail.com" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/70 transition-colors">email me</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
